  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The International Atomic Energy Agency is the world&apos;s central intergovernmental forum for scientific and technical co-operation in the nuclear field. It works for the safe, secure and peaceful uses of nuclear science and technology, contributing to international peace and security and the United Nations&apos; Sustainable Development Goals. Funding under this investment represents Australia core contribution to the IAEA.</narrative>
